<title>USA: Schoolcraft, Mich., repriced, top yield lowered.</title>
<headline>Schoolcraft, Mich., repriced, top yield lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>EVEREN Securities Inc said Monday it repriced and restructured Schoolcraft Community Schools, Mich.'s $17.9 million bond issues, lowering the top yield in 2026 to 5.86 percent from 5.875 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
